          "entry_id": 2975,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.5136982,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Do you offer virtual or telehealth consultations?\nAnswer: No, we currently only offer in-person visits at our clinic location.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2988,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.45138192,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## Language interpreters\n\nFree telephone interpreting is available in more than 200 languages for any appointment. Ask for it when you book or when you check in; there is no need to bring a family member to interpret. An American Sign Language (ASL) interpreter can attend in person if you ask at least 72 hours before your appointment.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2987,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.4497432,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Appointment reminders and messages from the clinic\n## Phone calls\n\nIf we cannot reach you by phone, we leave a voicemail with only the clinic's name, a callback number and your first name - never the reason for the call or any health details.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2973,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.4023773,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Do I need a referral from a primary care doctor to book with a specialist?\nAnswer: You can book a visit with any of our practitioners without a referral.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2989,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.3951605,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Your privacy and your health information\n## Recording a consultation\n\nYou may make an audio recording of your own consultation for your personal use, as long as you tell the practitioner before you start. Staff and other patients must not be recorded or photographed.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2986,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.38881385,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Running late\n## If you are running late\n\nCall the front desk on (212) 555-0142 as soon as you know you will be late, so we can tell the practitioner and plan around it. The phone line is answered Mo",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2989,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.38618073,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Your privacy and your health information\n## Conversations with the chat assistant\n\nConversations with the clinic's chat assistant are kept with your appointment records. Clinic staff can read them, ",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2986,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.3787092,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Running late\n## If the clinic is running late\n\nSometimes an earlier appointment takes longer than planned. If your practitioner is running more than 20 minutes behind, the front desk will tell you w",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2988,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.37517607,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## Bringing someone with you\n\nYou may bring one adult companion into the consulting room. Anyone else who comes with you can wait in the waiting area.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2988,
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "similarity_score": 0.3661778,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## While you wait\n\nFree guest Wi-Fi is available in the waiting area: the network is called VisitDoc-Guest, and the password is printed on the card at the front desk. Ple",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2987,
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "similarity_score": 0.3451622,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Appointment reminders and messages from the clinic\n## Changing your phone number or email address\n\nTell the front desk at check-in, or update the contact section of Form PR-1 at the self-check-in ki",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2983,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.33264053,
          "considered": false,
